<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h2 style="color: #333; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        New Bank Guarantee
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
        Dear {{data.recipientName}} (Accounts team),
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
        Please use the pre-filled forms attached below to prepare the following Bank Guarantee.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; margin: 20px 0;">
        The purpose of the Bank Guarantee is {{data.bgPurpose}}.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
        Please prepare the BG using the details below:
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG in favour of:</strong> {{data.beneficiaryName}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG address:</strong> {{data.beneficiaryAddress}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG Expiry Date:</strong> {{data.bgExpiryDate}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG Claim Date:</strong> {{data.claimDate}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Amount:</strong> Rs. {{data.amount}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG Stamp paper value:</strong> Rs. {{data.stampPaperValue}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>BG Format (Tender executive):</strong> attached.</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>PO copy/request letter from beneficiary:</strong> attached.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Beneficiary Account details:</strong></p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">Beneficiary Name: {{data.beneName}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">Account No.: {{data.beneAcc}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">IFSC code: {{data.beneIfsc}}</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">Unique Code: {{data.uniqueCode}}</p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; margin: 20px 0;">
        This BG is required within {{data.timeLimit}} Hrs.
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; background: #e8f4fd; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #2c3e50;">
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">
            Please review the BG format, if accepted, send a request to the bank using the
            <a href="{{data.stage1Link}}" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">Stage 1: Request to Bank</a>.
            If Corrections are required, reject the request and mention the corrections needed.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;">
            Please courier the BG to the address below keeping sufficient margin for the courier delivery time to ensure the BG reaches before the
            <strong>{{data.dueDateTime}}</strong> and share the SOFT COPY of the BG and the Docket slip along with SFMS confirmation with us on time using the form
            <a href="{{data.actionLink}}" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">{{data.actionLinkText}}</a>
            or your dashboard:
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Courier Address:</strong> {{data.courierAddress}}</p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin: 20px 0;">
        Please attach the cover letter with the bank guarantee when you courier the BG. (Attached below)
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666; font-style: italic; margin: 20px 0;">
        "Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth."
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-size: 12px; color: #888;">
        <p>Regards,</p>
        <p>Tender executive,</p>
        <p>Approved by Team Leader</p>
    </div>
</div>
